---
/**
 * The grid the landing cards sit in — fumadocs' own `Cards` classes, so the
 * two-column-to-one-column behaviour matches every other card grid in the
 * theme. See `card.astro` for why these are Astro components.
 */
---

<div class="not-prose grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 @container">
  <slot />
</div>
